  textoPT: "\xC9 s\xF3 voc\xEA prestar aten\xE7\xE3o nas formas de cada\nquadrado
    separadamente, divis\xF5es\ndiagonais s\xE3o multiplica\xE7\xE3o, enquanto as\nretas
    s\xE3o somas b\xE1sicas."
  textoEN: 'You just need to pay attention to the shapes of the

    squares individually,
    diagonal divisions

    are multiplication while the straight ones

    are basic
    additions.'
