  textoPT: "Sentinelas do Vazio\n\nNo campo onde o vento escolhe dan\xE7ar,\nergue-se
    uma casa tingida de verde,\nfolhas e paredes no mesmo tom.\n\nLogo adiante, repousa
    uma morada discreta,\nparedes simples, poucos adornos,\ncom sinais de velhice.\n\nNo
    fim da estrada, sentinela do sil\xEAncio,\numa torre que vigia o horizonte,\nolhos
    de vidro, guardi\xE3 do p\xF4r do sol.\n\nMais al\xE9m, buscando tocar as estrelas,\numa
    torre se ergue como prece de pedra,\nselada por energia de plasma."
  textoEN: "Sentinels of the Void\n\nIn the field where the wind chooses to dance,\nstands
    a house tinted in green,\nleaves and walls sharing the same hue.\n\nJust ahead,
    rests a modest dwelling,\nplain walls, little ornament,\nwith subtle signs of
    craft.\n\nAt the end of the road, sentinel \nof silence, a tower that watches
    the horizon,\nglass eyes, guardian of the sunset.\n\nFurther on, reaching for
    the stars,\na tower rises like a prayer of stone,\nsealed by plasma energy."
  useLayoutOverride: 0
  ptAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  ptScale: {x: 1, y: 1, z: 1}
  enAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  enScale: {x: 1, y: 1, z: 1}
