--- !u!114 &549882641
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 549882636}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 367ad717683bf1142b71d7eee7510893, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedText
  textoPT: "Ent\xE3o o capit\xE3o apareceu.\n\nOs olhos dele n\xE3o tinham mais nada
    humano. Lutou como um animal encurralado, l\xE2mina contra tr\xEAs, quatro homens.
    John viu dois ca\xEDrem antes de atravessarem o peito do capit\xE3o.\n\nCaindo
    de joelhos, Delacruz riu com sangue nos dentes.\n\nDo casaco, tirou uma concha
    negra, viva como se respirasse. Antes que algu\xE9m entendesse, ele a lan\xE7ou
    ao mar.\n\nO oceano respondeu.\n\nPrimeiro, o navio parou. Ap\xF3s isso, tent\xE1culos
    maiores que mastros emergiram, e o mundo virou \xE1gua, madeira quebrando e homens
    gritando.\n\nMas John n\xE3o morreu afogado. Ele se levanta\n e v\xEA o c\xE9u
    roxo. O mar, im\xF3vel como vidro. O Aurora Negra estava preso em um limbo.\n\nO
    kraken n\xE3o os devorou. Ele os guardou.\nO navio ficou aprisionado nos sonhos
    da criatura"
  textoEN: "Then the captain appeared.\n\nHis eyes held nothing human anymore. He
    fought like a cornered animal, blade against three, four men. John saw two fall
    before they drove steel through the captain\u2019s chest.\n\nFalling to his knees,
    Delacruz laughed, blood on his teeth.\n\nFrom his coat, he pulled a black shell,
    alive as if it breathed. Before anyone understood, he threw it into the sea.\n\nThe
    ocean answered.\n\nFirst, the ship stopped. Then, tentacles larger than masts
    rose, and the world became water, wood splintering and men screaming.\n\nBut
    John did not drown. He rises\nand sees the sky turned purple. The sea, still
    as glass. The Black Aurora was trapped in a limbo.\n\nThe kraken did not devour
    them. It kept them.\nThe ship was bound within the creature\u2019s dreams."
  useLayoutOverride: 0
  ptAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  ptScale: {x: 1, y: 1, z: 1}
  enAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  enScale: {x: 1, y: 1, z: 1}
