--- !u!114 &581397040
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 581397035}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 367ad717683bf1142b71d7eee7510893, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedText
  textoPT: "Voc\xEA sempre faz isso.\n\nEncontra um problema e n\xE3o solta mais.\nFica
    rodando em volta, virando, testando, desmontando\u2026 como se, em algum ponto,
    tudo finalmente fosse fazer sentido.\n\nEu s\xF3 dei forma a isso: Aproveite
    sua estadia em Somnium.\n\nEsse lugar \xE9 do jeito que voc\xEA pensa.\nEssas
    portas s\xE3o as perguntas que voc\xEA nunca deixou morrer.\nOs enigmas\u2026
    s\xE3o s\xF3 a vers\xE3o s\xF3lida da sua mania de n\xE3o ir embora.\n\nEngra\xE7ado\u2026
    voc\xEA acredita que est\xE1 avan\xE7ando, mas j\xE1 passou por aqui antes. S\xF3
    n\xE3o lembra, porque sua mente apaga o caminho quando percebe que n\xE3o h\xE1
    sa\xEDda f\xE1cil.\n\nMesmo assim, voc\xEA continua.\n\nVoc\xEA acha que est\xE1
    jogando.\nMas \xE9 s\xF3 voc\xEA fazendo, de novo, aquilo que sempre fez.\n"
  textoEN: "You always do this.\n\nYou find a problem and you just can't let it go.\nYou
    keep circling it, turning it over, testing it, taking it apart... as if, at some
    point, it will all finally make sense.\n\nI merely gave it shape: Enjoy your
    stay in Somnium.\n\nThis place works exactly like your mind.\nThese doors are
    the questions you never let die.\nThe puzzles\u2026 are just the physical form
    of your inability to walk away.\n\nFunny\u2026 you think you're moving forward,
    but you've been here before.\nYou just don't remember, because your mind erases
    the path once it realizes there's no easy way out.\n\nAnd yet, you keep going.\n\nYou
    think you're playing a game.\nBut it's really just you doing, all over again,
    exactly what you've always done."
  useLayoutOverride: 0
  ptAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  ptScale: {x: 1, y: 1, z: 1}
  enAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  enScale: {x: 1, y: 1, z: 1}
