--- !u!114 &1921865748
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1921865743}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 367ad717683bf1142b71d7eee7510893, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedText
  textoPT: "Ningu\xE9m no navio discordava de uma coisa: o capit\xE3o era um dem\xF4nio
    em pele de homem.\n\nA comida era podre, a \xE1gua contada em goles, e o chicote
    falava mais que qualquer ordem. Quem errava, sangrava. Quem reclamava, sumia.\n\nTodos
    aguentaram por meses. At\xE9 que a linha que segura um homem por dentro se rompeu.\n\nNuma
    noite sem lua, enquanto o mar parecia um po\xE7o sem fundo, um motim se iniciou.
    N\xE3o houve gritos de guerra, s\xF3 passos pesados e \xF3dio acumulado. Invadiram
    os aposentos do capit\xE3o. Ele n\xE3o estava, mas ela estava.\n\nA Senhora Delacruz
    nunca sujou as m\xE3os, mas tamb\xE9m nunca fechou os olhos. Ria quando algu\xE9m
    era punido. Mandava dobrar as correntes. Dizia que marinheiro era bicho.\n"
  textoEN: "No one on the ship disagreed on one thing: the captain was a demon in
    a man\u2019s skin.\n\nThe food was rotten, the water rationed in sips, and the
    whip spoke louder than any order. Those who failed bled. Those who complained
    disappeared.\n\nThey all endured it for months. Until the line that holds a man
    together snapped.\n\nOn a moonless night, while the sea felt like a bottomless
    pit, a mutiny began. There were no war cries, only heavy footsteps and bottled
    rage. They stormed the captain\u2019s quarters. He wasn\u2019t there\u2014but
    she was.\n\nLady Delacruz never dirtied her hands, but she never looked away
    either. She laughed when someone was punished. She ordered the chains tightened.
    She said sailors were beasts."
  useLayoutOverride: 0
  ptAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  ptScale: {x: 1, y: 1, z: 1}
  enAnchoredPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  enScale: {x: 1, y: 1, z: 1}
